<title>USA: AEP Industries Q3 shr $0.47 vs $0.41.</title>
<headline>AEP Industries Q3 shr $0.47 vs $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AEP Industries Inc.</p>
<p>				    Quarter Ended July 31,</p>
<p>					   1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales			   $63,907,000   $64,218,000</p>
<p> Gross profit		   15,619,000    14,078,000</p>
<p> Net income			2,305,000     3,003,000</p>
<p> Average shares		  4,946,000     7,412,000</p>
<p> Per share earnings		    .47	     .41</p>
<p>				   Nine Months Ended July 31,</p>
<p>					    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Sales			   174,498,000   181,252,000</p>
<p> Gross profit		   46,951,000    42,923,000</p>
<p> Net income			7,974,000     9,936,000</p>
<p> Average shares		  4,942,000     7,391,000</p>
<p> Per share earnings		   1.61	    1.34</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is AEP Industries Inc.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month sales lower mainly as a result of a 21-percent decrease in unit selling prices, which was offset by a 22-percent increase in sales volume.</p>
</text>
